                <pb facs="0412" n="304" sameAs="frus:frus1927v02/pg304"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.11/673: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-06-16T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 16, 1927—6
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>257. Your 646, June 16, 4 p.m. You are authorized to instruct Jacobs at Yunnanfu
                    as requested in paragraph 2 of your telegram. See Department’s 224, May 18, 4
                    p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
